[DESIGN_ITEM]
UID: SW-H10TG-33
TITLE: Radiation Emission View - Treatment Plan Staging Operational Point Parameters
STATEMENT: >>>
The application shall implement functionality to initiate a new treatment staging request.

This request shall include the following parameters for each point:

- Acceleration potential (kV), range 0 to 100 kV
- Emission current (mA), ranges from 0 to 1 mA
- Total delivery time, range 0 to TBD
- The remaining delivery time ranges from 0 to the total delivery time
- Beam optic focus adjustment values range from 0 to 3A
- Beam optic deflection adjustment values range -1.5A to +1.5A
- Filament current (mA), ranges from 0 to 3999 mA
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: RQ-H10TG-31
  ROLE: Refines

[DESIGN_ITEM]
UID: SW-H10TG-257
TITLE: Record Delivered Dose
STATEMENT: >>>

.. raw:: html

   <pre class="mermaid">
   sequenceDiagram
       autonumber
       
       box Application
           participant OperatePlanViewModelBase
           participant TreatmentModel
           participant ActualTreatmentFieldModel
           participant MainBoardModel
           participant TelemetryService
       end
       box ControlBoard
           participant Firmware
       end
       box Record & Verify
           participant TreatmentService
           participant ActualTreatmentFieldService
       end

       Note over OperatePlanViewModelBase, ActualTreatmentFieldService: User initiates emission delivery
       
       OperatePlanViewModelBase->>TreatmentModel: create new treatment
       activate OperatePlanViewModelBase
       activate TreatmentModel
       TreatmentModel->>TreatmentService: "grpc: CreateTreatment"
       activate TreatmentService
       Note over TreatmentService: create DB record
       TreatmentService-->>TreatmentModel: stored record
       deactivate TreatmentService
       deactivate TreatmentModel

       loop "[Telemetry polling]"
           TelemetryService->>Firmware: "[UDP] request telemetry"
           activate TelemetryService
           activate Firmware
           Firmware-->>TelemetryService: "[UDP] telemetry response"
           deactivate Firmware
           TelemetryService-->>OperatePlanViewModelBase: telemetry data
           deactivate TelemetryService
           
           alt "[Emission state: update treatment field from telemetry]"
               Note over OperatePlanViewModelBase: get telemetry CurrentOperationalPoint index
               OperatePlanViewModelBase->>OperatePlanViewModelBase: 
               Note over OperatePlanViewModelBase: get telemetry timer values
               OperatePlanViewModelBase->>OperatePlanViewModelBase: 
               OperatePlanViewModelBase->>ActualTreatmentFieldModel: "SaveActualTreatmentField(treatment, index, timer)"
           end
       end

       alt "[Leaving Emission state: update treatment field from the board]"
           OperatePlanViewModelBase->>MainBoardModel: query last OperationalPoint data
           activate MainBoardModel
           MainBoardModel->>Firmware: query operational point data
           activate Firmware
           Firmware-->>MainBoardModel: data response
           deactivate Firmware
           MainBoardModel-->>OperatePlanViewModelBase: point data
           deactivate MainBoardModel
           
           Note over OperatePlanViewModelBase: get timer value from point data
           OperatePlanViewModelBase->>OperatePlanViewModelBase: 
           OperatePlanViewModelBase->>ActualTreatmentFieldModel: "SaveActualTreatmentField(treatment, index, timer)"
           activate ActualTreatmentFieldModel
           
           alt "[new actual treatment field data]"
               ActualTreatmentFieldModel->>ActualTreatmentFieldService: "grpc: CreateActualTreatmentField"
               activate ActualTreatmentFieldService
               Note over ActualTreatmentFieldService: create DB record
               ActualTreatmentFieldService-->>ActualTreatmentFieldModel: stored record
               deactivate ActualTreatmentFieldService
           end
           
           alt "[existing actual treatment field data]"
               ActualTreatmentFieldModel->>ActualTreatmentFieldService: "grpc: UpdateActualTreatmentField"
               activate ActualTreatmentFieldService
               Note over ActualTreatmentFieldService: update DB record
               ActualTreatmentFieldService-->>ActualTreatmentFieldModel: stored record
               deactivate ActualTreatmentFieldService
           end
           deactivate ActualTreatmentFieldModel
       end
       deactivate OperatePlanViewModelBase
   </pre>
<<<
