[DESIGN_ITEM]
UID: SW-H10TG-270
TITLE: Retrieve Fault Information from Firmware
STATEMENT: >>>
The flow for Retrieving fault Information from Firmware should be implemented as described in the 
following sequence diagram:

.. raw:: html

    <pre class="mermaid">
    sequenceDiagram
        box Application
            participant FaultsViewModel
            participant MainBoardModelBase
            participant XRayService
        end
        box Control Board
            participant Firmware
        end

        activate FaultsViewModel
        FaultsViewModel->>MainBoardModelBase: GetFaults
        activate MainBoardModelBase
        MainBoardModelBase-->>FaultsViewModel: 
        
        MainBoardModelBase->>XRayService: GetFaults
        XRayService->>Firmware: (UDP) GetFaultInfo
        
        MainBoardModelBase-->>FaultsViewModel: return Faults
        deactivate MainBoardModelBase
        deactivate FaultsViewModel
