[DESIGN_ITEM]
UID: SW-H10TG-20
TITLE: Treatment Console - Activate emission delivery - Buttons' State
STATEMENT: >>>
The following are the labels and the enabled/disabled state of the buttons in every system state:

+--------------------------------------------------------------+-------------------------------+------------------------------+----------------------------------------------------------------+
| User Action                                                  | Machine State                 | Buttons' Label               | Buttons State                                                  |
+==============================================================+===============================+==============================+================================================================+
| Start                                                        | COLD                          | Prepare Beam-On Stop         | Prepare - Enabled Beam-On - Disabled Stop - Disabled           |
+--------------------------------------------------------------+-------------------------------+------------------------------+----------------------------------------------------------------+
| Prepare is pressed                                           | WARMUP                        | Warming Up Beam-On Stop      | Warming Up - progress bar Beam-On - Disabled Stop - Enabled    |
+--------------------------------------------------------------+-------------------------------+------------------------------+----------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                              | PRIMED ->Staged               | Loading Beam-On Stop         | Loading - progress bar Beam-On - Disabled Stop - Enabled       |
+--------------------------------------------------------------+-------------------------------+------------------------------+----------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                              | READY                         | Clear Plan Beam-On Stop      | Clear Plan - Enabled Beam-On - Enabled Stop - Disabled         |
+--------------------------------------------------------------+-------------------------------+------------------------------+----------------------------------------------------------------+
| Beam-On is pressed                                           | LAUNCHING                     | Clear Plan                   | Clear Plan - Disabled                                          |
+--------------------------------------------------------------+-------------------------------+------------------------------+----------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                              |                               | Launching Stop               | Launching - progress bar Stop - Enabled                        |
+--------------------------------------------------------------+-------------------------------+------------------------------+----------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                              | EMISSION                      | Clear Plan Beaming-On Stop   | Clear Plan - Disabled Beaming-On - progress bar Stop - Enabled |
+--------------------------------------------------------------+-------------------------------+------------------------------+----------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                              | STAGED                        | Clear Plan Reset Timers Stop | Clear Plan - Disabled Reset Timers - Enabled Stop - Disabled   |
+--------------------------------------------------------------+-------------------------------+------------------------------+----------------------------------------------------------------+
| Reset Timers is pressed                                      | STAGED/COLD                   | Clear Plan Beam-On Stop      | Clear Plan - Enabled Beam-On - Disabled Stop - Disabled        |
+--------------------------------------------------------------+-------------------------------+------------------------------+----------------------------------------------------------------+
| Fault occurred during Prepare                                | FAULT/COLD FAULT              | Clear Error Beam-On Stop     | Clear Error - Enabled Beam-On - Disabled Stop - Disabled       |
+--------------------------------------------------------------+-------------------------------+------------------------------+----------------------------------------------------------------+
| Clear Errors during Prepare is pressed                       | Fault->Warmup-> PRIMED        | Prepare Beam-On Stop         | Prepare - Enabled Beam On - Disabled Stop - Disabled           |
+--------------------------------------------------------------+-------------------------------+------------------------------+----------------------------------------------------------------+
| Fault occurred during Emission                               | FAULT/COLD FAULT              | Clear Plan Clear Error Stop  | Clear Plan - Disabled Clear Error - Enabled Stop - Disabled    |
+--------------------------------------------------------------+-------------------------------+------------------------------+----------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                              |                               |                              |                                                                |
+--------------------------------------------------------------+-------------------------------+------------------------------+----------------------------------------------------------------+
| Clear Errors during emission is pressed ( also Clear timers) | Fault->Warmup-> PRIMED/STAGED | Clear Plan Resume Stop       | Clear Plan - enabled Resume - Enabled Stop- Disabled           |
+--------------------------------------------------------------+-------------------------------+------------------------------+----------------------------------------------------------------+
| Resume is Pressed                                            | READY                         | Clear Plan Beam-ON Stop      | Clear Plan - Enabled Beam-On- Enabled Stop - Disabled          |
+--------------------------------------------------------------+-------------------------------+------------------------------+----------------------------------------------------------------+
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: RQ-H10TG-53
  ROLE: Refines

